O6SJc6TYiJ7","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-13T07:25:17Z","updated_at":"2024-11-13T07:34:20Z","body":"@jaydensipe There are probably some cases where you'd want the copy button in regular message notifications if there's a script that shows you some interesting info like some scene stats and you don't want to outright add `DisplayServer.clipboard_set()` to it yourself. It's probably not something you'd want often, but I think it's fine if all of them have the button, it's a small button after all and it might not be worth to bloat the API because of it\r\n\r\nWhat I think might be interesting to consider in the future though is persistent toasts with action buttons:\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faea1f44-84f1-419d-a164-2cbc7b902607\" width=500/>\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2472682107/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perf